WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.466 --> 00:00:06.033
Our heroes brought Goodra back to its home in the wetlands,

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.433
and everyone is saying their goodbyes.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.133
It's awesome we were able to battle together.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.533
Goodra.

5
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.133
Hey, don't be sad. I'll see you again.

6
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.533
Take care, Goodra.

7
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.333
Thanks again.

8
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.966
Goodra.

9
00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:46.400
Everybody, get along.

10
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.533
See you later.

11
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.900
Goodbye, everyone.

12
00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:50.933
See you.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.566
- Pika, pika!
- Goodra. Goodra.

14
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:04.333
Say, the airport's up and running again.

15
00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:08.133
Yeah? When we get back to Lumiose City, I'll fly home.

16
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.966
I guess that means our journey's almost over.

17
00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.033
It's kind of sad, you know?

18
00:01:19.933 --> 00:01:21.033
Something wrong?

19
00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:22.366
I'm not sure.

20
00:01:24.466 --> 00:01:25.666
Ninja.

21
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.533
Greninja? What's going on?

22
00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:35.566
What's that?

23
00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.233
One of those vines like before.

24
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:45.866
- Could Team Flare be doing all this?
- Pika?

25
00:01:50.966 --> 00:01:54.566
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

26
00:01:54.633 --> 00:01:58.666
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

27
00:01:58.733 --> 00:02:01.700
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

28
00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:04.833
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

29
00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.566
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

30
00:02:06.633 --> 00:02:09.733
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

31
00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.966
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

32
00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:14.766
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

33
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.566
I wonder if this could be the work of a group of some sort.

34
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.800
A group like Team Flare.

35
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.566
But I thought Squishy got rid of them all.

36
00:02:35.466 --> 00:02:38.933
We've gotta get rid of them right away. You ready, Greninja?

37
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.066
Ninja.

38
00:02:51.633 --> 00:02:53.900
You're right. I see it, too.

39
00:02:57.066 --> 00:02:58.733
What, Ash? What do you see?

40
00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.066
It's some red thing.

41
00:03:02.033 --> 00:03:04.166
Got it. At least it's worth a try.

42
00:03:04.733 --> 00:03:06.666
Okay, Greninja. Water shuriken.

43
00:03:15.933 --> 00:03:18.433
- You did it.
- It lost its strength.

44
00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:21.133
Wonder if it came from that red glow.

45
00:03:21.633 --> 00:03:22.966
Pika.

46
00:03:30.766 --> 00:03:32.200
Now what's going on?

47
00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.233
Look out!

48
00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:43.733
Hey!

49
00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.400
- It's a Cell.
- It's Squishy's friend.

50
00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.566
- It's you.
- We meet again.

51
00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:57.466
- Clemont, who's he?
- Ha-ha-ha.

52
00:03:57.533 --> 00:04:00.433
Xerosic. Team Flare's scientist.

53
00:04:00.533 --> 00:04:01.533
I battled him.

54
00:04:02.633 --> 00:04:04.133
But I thought I...

55
00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.733
No way!

56
00:04:11.933 --> 00:04:14.833
True, I lost to you back then.

57
00:04:15.433 --> 00:04:17.800
But I'm miraculously back.

58
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:24.100
And I'm now in the process of creating Team Neo Flare.

59
00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.033
Team Neo Flare?

60
00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.433
What are you gonna do?

61
00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.500
Give back Squishy's friend now!

62
00:04:32.133 --> 00:04:33.633
No, I can't do that.

63
00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.600
I'm going to get every Cell and obtain Zygarde Complete Forme.

64
00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.933
Lysandre's ambitions will then be able to come true.

65
00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:46.466
I'll never let you get away with that. Greninja, smash that thing.

66
00:04:46.533 --> 00:04:47.866
Water shuriken.

67
00:04:49.266 --> 00:04:51.300
Stop them with signal beam.

68
00:04:55.633 --> 00:04:57.300
Clemont, they took it.

69
00:04:57.366 --> 00:04:59.900
And I know that Cell is Squishy's friend.

70
00:05:03.566 --> 00:05:05.433
You'll be coming with us, too.

71
00:05:07.566 --> 00:05:09.900
Clemont! No!

72
00:05:10.566 --> 00:05:11.533
No!

73
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.966
You can catch up to them. Do it.

74
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:25.833
- What are you planning to do with me?
- Your scientific knowledge will be useful.

75
00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.666
You will join us, of course.

76
00:05:27.733 --> 00:05:29.033
I'll never help you.

77
00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.333
Oh, I don't need you to agree.

78
00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:36.333
If I use my control system on you, you'll do as I say, just like Zygarde did.

79
00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:37.900
You'll be an enhanced human.

80
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.366
- Prepare to use the beam.
- Wait. Don't use the beam.

81
00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:48.600
I have one request. May I clean my glasses first?

82
00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:51.533
Ha, ha. That's all? But of course.

83
00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.900
Thanks very much.

84
00:05:57.533 --> 00:05:58.600
Now, ready?

85
00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:00.400
Let's begin.

86
00:06:04.333 --> 00:06:06.766
When I say no, I mean no!

87
00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:09.266
My close-up should be right here!

88
00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:11.900
It should be when I give Inkay my command.

89
00:06:11.966 --> 00:06:13.933
- Please.
- Now hear this.

90
00:06:14.066 --> 00:06:16.966
It's gonna be when I was flying the news copter.

91
00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:17.866
- What?
- What?

92
00:06:17.933 --> 00:06:22.166
The point of editing this is so it looks like we destroyed Team Flare,

93
00:06:22.233 --> 00:06:26.100
- not the twerps, you twit.
- What do we do if the boss finds out?

94
00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:41.433
That came out of nowhere.

95
00:06:41.733 --> 00:06:44.500
But what I'm asking is, just what was that?

96
00:06:45.833 --> 00:06:47.700
You recorded the whole thing?

97
00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:51.466
Genius. I'll edit that golden nugget into our scene.

98
00:06:51.533 --> 00:06:52.566
Hands off!

99
00:06:52.633 --> 00:06:53.900
I'm the genius here!

100
00:06:59.733 --> 00:07:02.600
My dear Cell, where are you?

101
00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.633
Greninja just found them.

102
00:07:16.733 --> 00:07:17.833
How's Clemont?

103
00:07:18.066 --> 00:07:21.100
Well, all I see are Xerosic and Malamar.

104
00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:22.000
Pika.

105
00:07:22.466 --> 00:07:25.100
Think you can sneak inside somehow, Greninja?

106
00:07:28.566 --> 00:07:30.033
Oh, there you are.

107
00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.900
Malamar, use psychic.

108
00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.433
Oh, no.

109
00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.366
What are you doing here?

110
00:07:53.433 --> 00:07:55.000
Malamar, use signal beam.

111
00:07:58.866 --> 00:08:00.933
Greninja, water shuriken.

112
00:08:05.466 --> 00:08:08.133
- There they are.
- You give both of them back.

113
00:08:08.733 --> 00:08:10.200
Retreat for now.

114
00:08:10.633 --> 00:08:13.333
All right, Malamar, use psycho cut.

115
00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.666
No, it can't be.

116
00:08:26.733 --> 00:08:27.566
It's fine.

117
00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.766
Greninja's fine.

118
00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.600
It's hiding underneath.

119
00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.733
- Yeah?
- Pikachu?

120
00:08:36.799 --> 00:08:37.633
Yeah.

121
00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.799
Thank goodness.

122
00:08:39.866 --> 00:08:41.000
Okay, let's go.

123
00:09:04.766 --> 00:09:07.166
It looks like I've gotten away.

124
00:09:07.233 --> 00:09:10.066
And by now that thing should be finished.

125
00:09:13.466 --> 00:09:15.133
I can see them up there.

126
00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.133
- Let's go.
- Right.

127
00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.033
Right.

128
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:22.700
Who's that Pokémon?

129
00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.933
It's Zygarde Complete Forme.

130
00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:37.966
So...

131
00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.200
How are you feeling now?

132
00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:41.933
I feel great.

133
00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.300
Thanks to you, Xerosic, leader of Team Neo Flare.

134
00:09:46.366 --> 00:09:47.966
That has such a nice ring.

135
00:09:50.466 --> 00:09:51.300
We're here.

136
00:09:55.900 --> 00:10:00.000
I know Greninja's flying around here, though I can't see just where.

137
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.300
Greninja, we're here, up at the top of the mountain.

138
00:10:08.033 --> 00:10:11.100
I see it. I should be able to reach it if I jump.

139
00:10:11.533 --> 00:10:12.933
I'll hop on that plane.

140
00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.533
Not from here.

141
00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:16.133
What happens if you fall?

142
00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.666
I can't let them escape.

143
00:10:17.833 --> 00:10:19.033
I've gotta do it.

144
00:10:19.666 --> 00:10:20.500
I'm going.

145
00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:23.033
- Okay, with me?
- Pika, pika!

146
00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.566
I'm going, too.

147
00:10:25.633 --> 00:10:26.533
Me, too.

148
00:10:27.033 --> 00:10:31.266
- We're always a team, right?
- All right. Make sure you do what I say.

149
00:10:37.866 --> 00:10:40.300
Now. Let's go!

150
00:11:00.766 --> 00:11:01.600
Ninja.

151
00:11:02.066 --> 00:11:03.466
You did it, Greninja.

152
00:11:03.533 --> 00:11:04.566
Yeah, thank you.

153
00:11:04.633 --> 00:11:06.033
That was a close one.

154
00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:08.933
Clemont.

155
00:11:09.533 --> 00:11:10.833
Where could he be?

156
00:11:12.066 --> 00:11:13.466
- Clemont!
- Clemont!

157
00:11:15.933 --> 00:11:19.633
I welcome you all to the unveiling of the enhanced human.

158
00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:20.666
What did you do?

159
00:11:20.733 --> 00:11:23.700
Give me back my brother and Squishy's friend now!

160
00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:28.100
Your brother is currently being mind-controlled

161
00:11:28.166 --> 00:11:31.666
and has become Team Neo Flare's first enhanced human.

162
00:11:32.766 --> 00:11:34.500
Yes, Xerosic, sir.

163
00:11:35.366 --> 00:11:37.300
- Clemont!
- Oh, it can't be.

164
00:11:37.366 --> 00:11:39.800
- Clemont, snap out of it.
- Pika!

165
00:11:40.233 --> 00:11:43.233
Unit 1, your first job is to capture them all.

166
00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.766
Right. As you wish.

167
00:11:47.466 --> 00:11:48.966
This can't be real.

168
00:11:49.266 --> 00:11:51.033
- Clemont.
- Pika, pika!

169
00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:54.066
There's no way Clemont could be that weak.

170
00:11:56.266 --> 00:11:58.733
He'd never give in to your mind control.

171
00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.700
Thank you for having faith in me, Ash.

172
00:12:08.133 --> 00:12:10.200
- Clemont, yes.
- What?

173
00:12:10.633 --> 00:12:12.166
You know I'm an inventor.

174
00:12:12.266 --> 00:12:14.766
The future is now, thanks to science.

175
00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:16.500
Clemontic Gear, on.

176
00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.633
After what happened before,

177
00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:22.033
I invented this multi-electromagnetic wave blocker.

178
00:12:22.666 --> 00:12:25.100
I call it Jamming Unit 1.

179
00:12:25.566 --> 00:12:29.966
I inconspicuously attached it while pretending to wipe off my glasses.

180
00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:33.466
- Unbelievable.
- That makes twice you've failed

181
00:12:33.533 --> 00:12:35.300
against one of my inventions.

182
00:12:35.733 --> 00:12:39.966
This device and my Clembot should prove whose inventions are superior.

183
00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.333
Time to admit you've been defeated.

184
00:12:42.966 --> 00:12:45.133
My inventions are inferior?

185
00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:46.833
This is not possible.

186
00:12:47.633 --> 00:12:49.833
Crobat, use air slash now.

187
00:12:51.433 --> 00:12:53.166
Chespin, pin missile.

188
00:12:55.133 --> 00:12:56.500
Chespin!

189
00:12:58.366 --> 00:13:01.200
- Clemont, let's get them together.
- All right.

190
00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:06.133
All right, Malamar, signal beam. And Crobat, wing attack.

191
00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:08.933
Now dodge it.

192
00:13:12.566 --> 00:13:13.400
Use tackle.

193
00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.000
You pesky little--

194
00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:22.133
I'm not going to let you annoying brats ruin my plan of perfection!

195
00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.100
Now, Crobat, use air slash.

196
00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:26.633
Water shuriken.

197
00:13:33.933 --> 00:13:35.600
Crobat, return.

198
00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:38.866
This is not acceptable.

199
00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.066
As long as I have my ideas and my genius mind,

200
00:13:42.133 --> 00:13:44.333
I'll be able to recreate this world.

201
00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.366
Defeat is not an option.

202
00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.300
Come back.

203
00:13:50.566 --> 00:13:52.100
Malamar, return.

204
00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:57.766
We must meet again. I'm not finished yet. See you again.

205
00:13:57.833 --> 00:13:59.266
You won't get away.

206
00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:03.933
Let go.

207
00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.000
You're gonna pay for all the awful things you did.

208
00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.700
From now on you need to invent things that help humanity.

209
00:14:18.933 --> 00:14:20.000
Tell me something.

210
00:14:20.966 --> 00:14:22.833
You've got a lot of strength.

211
00:14:22.966 --> 00:14:24.033
But why?

212
00:14:25.433 --> 00:14:28.033
Honestly, I wasn't that strong before.

213
00:14:28.466 --> 00:14:30.600
My time with Ash and all my friends

214
00:14:30.666 --> 00:14:34.466
and all we've experienced, that's given me the strength I have.

215
00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.200
Your friends.

216
00:14:37.333 --> 00:14:38.266
Now get in.

217
00:14:43.566 --> 00:14:45.200
Glad that's over with.

218
00:14:46.066 --> 00:14:49.200
Hey, you know Squishy, right? Squishy's your friend.

219
00:15:03.033 --> 00:15:03.866
What happened?

220
00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.233
Ahh! Squishy!

221
00:15:22.133 --> 00:15:24.333
I missed you. Feeling better now?

222
00:15:24.566 --> 00:15:25.766
My little Squishy.

223
00:15:27.433 --> 00:15:30.766
- We're getting to see Squishy again.
- That's great.

224
00:15:30.833 --> 00:15:32.900
- Sure is.
- Pika!

225
00:15:33.066 --> 00:15:34.733
Huh? What is it?

226
00:15:37.933 --> 00:15:38.966
Follow me.

227
00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.333
Where are you going?

228
00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.233
Come on.

229
00:16:00.333 --> 00:16:01.333
Zygarde.

230
00:16:02.633 --> 00:16:06.000
Greninja, I've come to ask a favor of you.

231
00:16:07.733 --> 00:16:10.800
- Pika?
- Was that the voice of Zygarde?

232
00:16:10.866 --> 00:16:12.133
It's telepathy.

233
00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.466
The vines that reappeared,

234
00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.400
their roots have burrowed deep into the ground,

235
00:16:17.466 --> 00:16:20.133
and they emerge by absorbing negative energy.

236
00:16:20.733 --> 00:16:23.433
What we destroyed was merely on the surface.

237
00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:28.133
Scars from the incident that nearly destroyed the world are deep.

238
00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:32.633
The two of us are destroying the roots that scattered throughout Kalos.

239
00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.633
However, it's difficult for even me to pinpoint their exact locations.

240
00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:42.866
Yet, Greninja, it seems that you are somehow able to locate them.

241
00:16:44.366 --> 00:16:45.833
- Ja.
- Ah?

242
00:16:48.133 --> 00:16:50.233
So, that was the negative energy.

243
00:16:51.066 --> 00:16:53.866
I do not know why only you possess that power,

244
00:16:54.133 --> 00:16:56.633
but I am in need of your assistance.

245
00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.633
Will you help us with your power?

246
00:17:01.066 --> 00:17:02.666
- Power?
- Does that mean...?

247
00:17:08.566 --> 00:17:10.700
What'll it be? Greninja.

248
00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:19.066
I know. What happened before can never happen again.

249
00:17:22.966 --> 00:17:25.300
Remember what Professor Sycamore said?

250
00:17:25.633 --> 00:17:27.700
That maybe it wasn't a coincidence

251
00:17:27.766 --> 00:17:31.100
that I met you way back when you were still a Froakie.

252
00:17:34.133 --> 00:17:37.533
I think maybe he was right. It wasn't a coincidence.

253
00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.700
That when you and I power up, it isn't an accident.

254
00:17:52.466 --> 00:17:55.466
Maybe your power was always meant for this moment.

255
00:18:11.066 --> 00:18:12.433
Ninja.

256
00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.200
Thanks.

257
00:18:15.233 --> 00:18:18.133
You always became stronger to help someone else.

258
00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:22.933
So, now this time, you'll help Kalos and the world.

259
00:18:26.566 --> 00:18:28.566
It's like something's telling you

260
00:18:28.633 --> 00:18:32.066
what you need to do now is find all that negative energy.

261
00:18:33.433 --> 00:18:34.366
Don't worry.

262
00:18:34.633 --> 00:18:38.433
We'll always be connected, even if we're not in the same place.

263
00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:42.533
The truth is, we won't ever really be apart.

264
00:18:47.333 --> 00:18:49.033
Pikachu?

265
00:18:51.233 --> 00:18:53.000
This is what you've gotta do.

266
00:19:10.666 --> 00:19:12.033
Oh, Greninja.

267
00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.566
Greninja.

268
00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.500
That's right.

269
00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.933
This is how it has to be.

270
00:19:37.166 --> 00:19:39.266
- Greninja.
- Thank you.

271
00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:43.066
Ash, Greninja will be in my care.

272
00:19:43.733 --> 00:19:46.133
Yeah. I'm counting on you, Squishy.

273
00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.066
Hey, Squishy.

274
00:19:48.366 --> 00:19:51.566
We probably won't see each other for a while, Bonnie.

275
00:19:52.566 --> 00:19:56.566
It's okay. I know that you've got a lot of important work to do.

276
00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.833
I'll always be cheering you on, you know.

277
00:20:00.266 --> 00:20:02.566
I'll always be with you, too, Bonnie.

278
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.600
I'll find you when I become a Trainer.

279
00:20:05.666 --> 00:20:08.433
We'll be together again. That's a promise.

280
00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.700
Yes, that's a promise.

281
00:20:22.266 --> 00:20:24.366
Take care of yourself, Greninja.

282
00:20:24.833 --> 00:20:26.966
You, too, Squishy. Take care.

283
00:20:31.633 --> 00:20:33.900
Greninja and Ash may be parting ways,

284
00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:37.100
but this also means the beginning of new encounters.

285
00:20:37.166 --> 00:20:39.500
In search of their own new encounters,

286
00:20:39.566 --> 00:20:43.566
our heroes will no doubt experience many new and exciting adventures,

287
00:20:43.633 --> 00:20:45.800
as the journey continues.
